  "description": "FFmpeg 8.1.3's shared libraries for linux-arm64, built for decoding plus AAC, MP3, PCM, MPEG-2 and MPEG-4 encoding and common muxers (yadif, fps, aspectralstats, FrameReader's audio filters and TestMedia's sources the only filters; zlib and dav1d for PNG and AV1 linked in), so ShotDetector decodes and probes in-process: faster and with about half the memory of the ffmpeg executable, with the same results. LGPL-2.1-or-later, as FFmpeg (dav1d: BSD-2-Clause); the build recipe is configure.txt in the package.",
